      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ee974f1813f4b99849e84fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔哇～超难！",
      "source_fingerprint": "46400f42f6ad2f9ac49a907dc0ec22b2a014720e67ac3a7b94e7b31202fdeff3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3137066b04bd1184a6134639",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这游戏太难了吧！？天啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7de93b2a984812ee8f7fea00e3a491667eaf0618a6428740d5620edcbb09760",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d4b21cb0fd1693753dc5295",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿咻～！\r\n简单来讲就是我最棒吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e6f3efa92e9bedb647eef61c441571d175e3a001269fd8434771f4c5a027077",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af227830318274adc08b2249",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样啊～！很帅气吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "52b69ac5e4963a9273c19a6357ae4e3ad4bf811313ac4fa2edf8a8be043839fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0863aeae5f76f7e501b750a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うぇいうぇいー！\r\nリードはウチに、まかセロリ☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f940f1c0d50dc323cd86dad728e76ba92f866ec4a7e2881dcb3c1f85c8c4a55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ea866666e935943bb22c2d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どやどや～！イケメてっしょ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "251d294b881b4cdac98119298435df689a8d06f7ca3d19905bcc62beb3989613",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f53f3553cb7a1b2ae3e2b9cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轰隆隆隆隆～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7ecb982b85b5055b5bc6c6d1691ae6ca55b8a6c0097780587bf1683b393648d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df6307b9dfd06819ca394f48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "砰砰～！冲吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "abd8e11e9db1036abb170cb1a3f647fc1f134a879ba958772e362dcd42897477",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69faad65d3f4168939ad4464",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鬼アピったるべ～！逆に五七五とか\r\nありよりのあり！？ルビー色～\r\n吸い込まれそう♡らびゅすぎる♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "b83cfb39eb8fe1866df774cb4b3c900aa9329a0e3429aafbdb5ba5bc331085e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12af93c10a7178734e09b7cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "超热──☆太阳很嗨耶！\r\n只能比谁才是真正的玩咖啦！？\r\n太阳？太阳！太阳？太阳──♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e687906e60aa7e4fe08aa35966e47718e8e9a03473be183ed9dcf81b1a44ccc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e88e508669b14d5be8f8d18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "服装的装饰真的让人很嗨呢☆\r\n果然跟好麻吉用同样的风格穿搭，\r\n能让人嗨到不行呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9a4597fefa9be7fe15bc839eb7c69cd75543ece4ce0f4255b8b0e5c01bcdc34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06f3b81c31ed9d7e34792e89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "んへへへっ、お嬢とでぇと♡\r\nマジきゃぱぱ♡　しょーみ最強？？\r\n――ベスデ、ぜってー獲る！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0824695d33caf3efaf402be6fcb4ae65873f16e874a9a52c6689dc8423eccc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2e81a8a7589fa9aed49c451",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我不太懂！但先抬起头来吧？\r\n有我在！就会冒出笑容对吧☆\r\n只要有最强的我陪着就无敌啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "05786bac3bc57a32e3879a6f744473e0ee52382aa3d6b2ea6d9963c4b476d20a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c01b360bb03321705ebfd34f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ミラん！バンちゃむ！ゼファち！\r\nみんなサイコー！っぱフェスよな！\r\n…お嬢ともフェスれたち。にへ♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d5194f681e8ed75455a8b58e52e95ca4bfd3c0251ee4d1d2635b9bab24a432e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4314c660984edb2ce07eb94a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔耶～！太阳在此☆\r\n尽情地大闹吧！然后呢～哇哈哈哈♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f90e431b6a6f4805dd3e792ea4fde2d45b05ac89d62b3e2622fd0c00054278b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:656ac559d39c811cb1f3415f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果祭典结束了，\r\n再嗨一波就可以了啊！\r\n明天和后天也都要继续嗨喔☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "86d1b6921ee99bb1f9ad407d7ede9e701b376ea314b17acf8cef24bfe7de3f76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5fc4f8d8ecabd5091d70de2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最后的房间派对爆笑的～！\r\n我们吵到被骂整个超感动的笑死！\r\n好姐妹们，我们要一直在一起哦～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "a325eb323369bb48bc5bb00aae96d65f7c5b4c859c03578a699cc6d029900016",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8dbaa2309950a4a8a19f239",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "瞧瞧活动任务喔耶喔耶～！\r\n你一定可以立刻秀一波对吧！？\r\n嗨起来吧死党大声喊出Fuu☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c8fc73ee4abdb6aa78c3b156c255936f362cdb612b152b79706c547730232a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d23e9d000d7296dfc7be707",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦啦～！真的该赞爆！\r\n女孩们都超棒！随便都很棒☆\r\n反正结束嗨起来一切就喔耶～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1f82e6ce45d1e64e959f4f8dcad399779c3b08aa9082bdb241d56ca36793cda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "400013"
      ]
    }
  ]
